---
// Warum V3. - 4 Kernvorteile als wiederverwendbarer Abschnitt
---

<section class="py-14 md:py-20 bg-white">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="text-center mb-10 reveal">
      <span class="badge mb-4 inline-block">Warum V3.?</span>
      <h2 class="abschnitt-titel">Seit 2008 dein Vorteil.</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4 md:gap-6">

      <div class="karte reveal text-center border-t-4 border-gelb-400">
        <div class="w-11 h-11 bg-gelb-400/20 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-3">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-gelb-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-display font-700 text-blau-900 text-sm md:text-base mb-1">Keine Wartezeit</h3>
        <p class="text-schiefer-500 text-xs md:text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Fahrstunden starten sofort. Kein Simulator-Zwang.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="karte reveal text-center border-t-4 border-gelb-400">
        <div class="w-11 h-11 bg-gelb-400/20 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-3">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-gelb-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 6V4m0 2a2 2 0 100 4m0-4a2 2 0 110 4m-6 8a2 2 0 100-4m0 4a2 2 0 110-4m0 4v2m0-6V4m6 6v10m6-2a2 2 0 100-4m0 4a2 2 0 110-4m0 4v2m0-6V4" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-display font-700 text-blau-900 text-sm md:text-base mb-1">B197 als Standard</h3>
        <p class="text-schiefer-500 text-xs md:text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Start auf Automatik, voller Führerschein.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="karte reveal text-center border-t-4 border-gelb-400">
        <div class="w-11 h-11 bg-gelb-400/20 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-3">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-gelb-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4M7.835 4.697a3.42 3.42 0 001.946-.806 3.42 3.42 0 014.438 0 3.42 3.42 0 001.946.806 3.42 3.42 0 013.138 3.138 3.42 3.42 0 00.806 1.946 3.42 3.42 0 010 4.438 3.42 3.42 0 00-.806 1.946 3.42 3.42 0 01-3.138 3.138 3.42 3.42 0 00-1.946.806 3.42 3.42 0 01-4.438 0 3.42 3.42 0 00-1.946-.806 3.42 3.42 0 01-3.138-3.138 3.42 3.42 0 00-.806-1.946 3.42 3.42 0 010-4.438 3.42 3.42 0 00.806-1.946 3.42 3.42 0 013.138-3.138z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-display font-700 text-blau-900 text-sm md:text-base mb-1">Transparent und fair</h3>
        <p class="text-schiefer-500 text-xs md:text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Keine versteckten Kosten. Preisgarantie 6 Monate.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="karte reveal text-center border-t-4 border-gelb-400">
        <div class="w-11 h-11 bg-gelb-400/20 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-3">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-gelb-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 20h5v-2a3 3 0 00-5.356-1.857M17 20H7m10 0v-2c0-.656-.126-1.283-.356-1.857M7 20H2v-2a3 3 0 015.356-1.857M7 20v-2c0-.656.126-1.283.356-1.857m0 0a5.002 5.002 0 019.288 0M15 7a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0zm6 3a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0zM7 10a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-display font-700 text-blau-900 text-sm md:text-base mb-1">9er-Team</h3>
        <p class="text-schiefer-500 text-xs md:text-sm leading-relaxed">
          9 Fahrlehrerinnen und Fahrlehrer. Persönliche Betreuung.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
